//MAGE ROBE OF COLD RESISTANCE - valore 800mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/CLCK09.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Mage Robe"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "Since the age of Netheril, mages have learned to bestow a wide variety of magical properties upon the everyday objects that surround them. A favorite item of such enchantment is the common robe. It is lightweight, affordable, and holds its enchantment well, thereby making it ideal equipment for a mage. Due to their magical heritage, however, only single-, dual-, and multi-class mages may wear these enchanted robes.

STATISTICS:

Weight: 3"

	SAY NAME2 "Mage Robe of Cold Resistance"
	SAY DESC "These are a common sight in the Sword Coast region, especially as one travels north toward Neverwinter and the Icewind Dales. Many young mages receive it as a gift from their instructors upon successfully completing their first five years of study. As with other such robes, they can only be worn by those of the wizardly profession.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
- Armor Class: 9
– Cold Resistance: +25%

Weight: 3"




//MAGE ROBE OF FIRE RESISTANCE - valore 800mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/CLCK10.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Mage Robe"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "Since the age of Netheril, mages have learned to bestow a wide variety of magical properties upon the everyday objects that surround them. A favorite item of such enchantment is the common robe. It is lightweight, affordable, and holds its enchantment well, thereby making it ideal equipment for a mage. Due to their magical heritage, however, only single-, dual-, and multi-class mages may wear these enchanted robes.

STATISTICS:

Weight: 3"

	SAY NAME2 "Mage Robe of Fire Resistance"
	SAY DESC "Due to the extremely volatile nature of most magics, Mage Robes of Fire Resistance are not uncommon among young acolytes and their wizardly tutors. As with other such robes, they cannot be worn except by wizards.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
- Armor Class: 9
– Fire Resistance: +25%

Weight: 3"





//MAGE ROBE OF ELECTRIC RESISTANCE - valore 800mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/CLCK11.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Mage Robe"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "Since the age of Netheril, mages have learned to bestow a wide variety of magical properties upon the everyday objects that surround them. A favorite item of such enchantment is the common robe. It is lightweight, affordable, and holds its enchantment well, thereby making it ideal equipment for a mage. Due to their magical heritage, however, only single-, dual-, and multi-class mages may wear these enchanted robes.

STATISTICS:

Weight: 3"

	SAY NAME2 "Mage Robe of Electric Resistance"
	SAY DESC "While seen with less frequency than some other mage robes, those of Electrical Resistance can hardly be considered a rarity. Some are worn by paranoiacs seeking protection from a ragged mountain storm, but many more are worn by mages seeking to protect themselves from the intrigues of others of their kind. As with all such robes, a Mage Robe of Electrical Resistance can only be worn by those of the wizardly profession.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
- Armor Class: 9
– Electricity Resistance: +25%

Weight: 3"




